      "body": "Full year 2025 results: EPS: ₹20.89 (up from ₹10.90 loss in FY 2024). Revenue: ₹3.67b (down 5.7% from FY 2024). Net income: ₹103.1m (up ₹157.0m from FY 2024). Profit margin: 2.8% (up from net loss in FY 2024). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 45% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 51% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
