      "body": "John Cockerill India Limited at its board of directors meeting held on February 26, 2026 recommended the final dividend at the rate of INR 7 per share i.e., 70.00% to the Equity shareholders of the Company for the financial year 2025 subject to the approval of the shareholders at the ensuing Annual General Meeting of the Company. The record date for determining the eligibility of members entitled to receive dividend on equity shares is March 6, 2026. The dividend, if declared, shall be paid within the stipulated timelines.",
