      "title": "John Cockerill India Limited Appoints Pierre Pascal T Dosogne as Senior Management Personnel, Effective February 26, 2026",
      "body": "John Cockerill India Limited, at its Board of Directors meeting held on February 26, 2026, on the recommendation of the Nomination & Remuneration Committee, approved the appointment of Mr. Pierre Pascal T Dosogne, HR Business Partner Industry (Metals) (under the category of Senior Management Personnel) of the Company. Mr. Pierre Pascal T Dosogne is a John Cockerill Group-level HR and transformation leader with over 10 years of experience in multinational industrial environments. He specializes in HR operations at scale, workforce strategy, M&A integration, and digital transformation, combining strong execution discipline with a solid business and people leadership mindset. In his current role as HR Business Partner for the Metals Business at John Cockerill, Pierre partners closely with sen",
