      "title": "John Cockerill India Limited Appoints Nidhi Narayan Salampuria as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer, Effective December 19, 2025",
      "body": "John Cockerill India Limited appointed Ms. Nidhi Narayan Salampuria as Company Secretary (Key Managerial Personnel) and Compliance Officer of the Company with effect from December 19, 2025. Ms. Nidhi Narayan Salampuria is a qualified Company Secretary and holds a fellow membership F10448 from the Institute of Company Secretaries of India. She also holds a Bachelor’s Degree in Law from Mumbai University, Diploma in Data Law Policy & Regulation from LSE, London, Diploma in Cyber Law and Forensics from NLU, Bangalore and Public Policy Certification from ISB, Hyderabad. Ms. Nidhi Narayan Salampuria is a seasoned legal and business management professional with over 15 years of diverse experience in Corporate Legal & Secretarial Compliances, Mergers & Acquisitions, Private Equity Investments, In",
